## 🛡️ Security Features

### Privacy Protection
- **Zero-Knowledge Proofs**: Votes verified without revealing voter identity
- **Encrypted Storage**: All sensitive data encrypted at rest
- **Secure Transmission**: TLS/SSL for all network communication
- **Wallet-Based Auth**: No passwords, only cryptographic signatures

### Smart Contract Security
- **Immutable Logic**: Deployed contracts cannot be modified
- **Access Controls**: Role-based permissions for admin functions
- **Rate Limiting**: Prevent spam and DDoS attacks
- **Reentrancy Guards**: Protection against common attack vectors
- **Formal Verification**: Mathematical proofs of contract correctness

### Infrastructure Security
- **DDoS Protection**: Cloudflare/AWS Shield integration
- **Input Validation**: All user inputs sanitized and validated
- **SQL Injection Prevention**: Parameterized queries and ORM
- **XSS Protection**: Content Security Policy headers
- **CORS Configuration**: Restricted cross-origin access

### Audit & Compliance
- **Audit Trail**: Complete immutable history on blockchain
- **Compliance Ready**: GDPR-compliant data handling
- **Regular Security Audits**: Third-party penetration testing
- **Bug Bounty Program**: Community-driven security testing

